## License Terms

### Tier 1: All Rights Reserved (Default)

Until cumulative donations reach 600 CNY, all content in this repository (including but not limited to novel chapters, outlines, and settings) is governed by the following terms:

- **Permitted**: Reading, sharing links to this repository, recommending to others, writing articles discussing and analyzing this project
- **Prohibited**: Copying chapter content, modifying, creating derivative works, distributing (both commercial and non-commercial)

Any prohibited acts without written authorization from the author constitute copyright infringement.

### Tier 2: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0

When cumulative donations reach 600 CNY, the license automatically upgrades to **Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)**.

Note: 600 CNY covers only 45% of the AI API costs for this project, excluding any labor or time investment.

Under this license you may:

- **Share** — copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format
- **Adapt** — remix, transform, and build upon the material

Under the following terms:

- **Attribution (BY)** — You must give appropriate credit, provide a link to this repository, and indicate if changes were made
- **NonCommercial (NC)** — You may not use the material for commercial purposes
- **ShareAlike (SA)** — If you remix, transform, or build upon the material, you must distribute your contributions under the same license as the original

Full legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode

### Tier 3: CC BY 4.0

When cumulative donations reach 1200 CNY, the license automatically upgrades to **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)**.

Note: 1200 CNY covers only 90% of the AI API costs — it still does not account for the substantial time and effort spent on project setup, toolchain debugging, and generation supervision. In other words, even at this level, the author is still operating at a loss.

Under this license you may:

- **Share** — copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format
- **Adapt** — remix, transform, and build upon the material for any purpose, including commercial

Under the following terms:

- **Attribution (BY)** — You must give appropriate credit, provide a link to this repository, and indicate if changes were made

Full legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

### License Upgrades Are Irreversible

Once the license upgrades to a tier, it **will not revert**. This license upgrade constitutes an irrevocable unilateral commitment by the author to the general public. For example, if cumulative donations reach 600 CNY and the license upgrades to CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, it will remain CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 even if no further donations are made.

Copies distributed under a prior tier's license continue to be governed by that tier's terms. Content obtained after an upgrade is subject to the new license.

